OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAreas of
OL,6,Fcloud across the west with patchy
OL,7,Fdrizzle and hill fog over the Dales.
OL,8,FClearer spells develop elsewhere
OL,9,Facross the region through the evening
OL,10,Fand overnight with the odd fog patch
OL,11,Fdeveloping. Mild overnight with light
OL,12,Fwinds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FA bright start for most
OL,15,Falthough cloud remains over the
OL,16,FPennines. Cloud bubbles up for many
OL,17,Fareas but mostly remaining dry and
OL,18,Ffeeling warm in sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
